<title>USA: U.S. Filter completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>U.S. Filter completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>PALM DESERT, Calif. 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>United States Filter Corp and Wheelabrator Technologies Inc said U.S. Filter completed the previously announced acquisition of Wheelabrator's industrial water process, manufacturing and custom-engineered systems businesses for approximately $370 million in cash.</p>
</text>
